      "ref_id": "Matius 14:2",
      "book_code": "mat",
      "book_en": "Matthew",
      "book_id": "Matius",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "diatessaron_verse": "6",
      "ref": "Mark 6:17",
      "arabic_page": 70,
      "text": "Sebab memang Herodeslah yang menyuruh orang menangkap Yohanes dan membelenggunya di penjara berhubung dengan peristiwa Herodias, isteri Filipus saudaranya, karena Herodes",
      "ref_id": "Markus 6:17",
      "book_code": "mrk",
      "book_en": "Mark",
      "book_id": "Markus",
      "word_count": 21
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "diatessaron_verse": "7",
      "ref": "Mark 6:17",
      "arabic_page": 70,
      "text": "telah mengambilnya sebagai isteri.",
      "ref_id": "Markus 6:17",
      "book_code": "mrk",
      "book_en": "Mark",
      "book_id": "Markus",
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "diatessaron_verse": "7",
      "ref": "Mark 6:18",
      "arabic_page": 70,
      "text": "Karena Yohanes pernah menegor Herodes: \"Tidak halal engkau mengambil isteri",
      "ref_id": "Markus 6:18",
      "book_code": "mrk",
      "book_en": "Mark",
      "book_id": "Markus",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "diatessaron_verse": "8",
      "ref": "Mark 6:18",
      "arabic_page": 70,
      "text": "saudaramu!\"",
      "ref_id": "Markus 6:18",
      "book_code": "mrk",
      "book_en": "Mark",
      "book_id": "Markus",
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "diatessaron_verse": "8",
      "ref": "Mark 6:19",
      "arabic_page": 70,
      "text": "Karena itu Herodias menaruh dendam pada Yohanes dan bermaksud untuk membunuh dia, tetapi tidak dapat,",
      "ref_id": "Markus 6:19",
      "book_code": "mrk",
      "book_en": "Mark",
      "book_id": "Markus",
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "diatessaron_verse": "9",
      "ref": "Mark 6:20",
      "arabic_page": 70,
      "text": "sebab Herodes segan akan Yohanes karena ia tahu, bahwa Yohanes adalah orang yang benar dan suci,",
      "ref_id": "Markus 6:20",
      "book_code": "mrk",
      "book_en": "Mark",
      "book_id": "Markus",
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "diatessaron_verse": "10",
      "ref": "Mark 6:20",
      "arabic_page": 70,
      "text": "jadi ia melindunginya. Tetapi apabila ia mendengarkan Yohanes, hatinya selalu terombang-ambing, namun ia merasa senang juga mendengarkan dia.",
      "ref_id": "Markus 6:20",
      "book_code": "mrk",
      "book_en": "Mark",
      "book_id": "Markus",
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
