      "book_code": "mat",
      "book_en": "Matthew",
      "book_id": "Matius",
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "diatessaron_verse": "11",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:5",
      "arabic_page": 70,
      "text": "sebagai nabi.",
      "ref_id": "Matius 14:5",
      "book_code": "mat",
      "book_en": "Matthew",
      "book_id": "Matius",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "diatessaron_verse": "11",
      "ref": "Mark 6:21",
      "arabic_page": 70,
      "text": "Akhirnya tiba juga kesempatan yang baik bagi Herodias, ketika Herodes pada hari ulang tahunnya mengadakan perjamuan untuk pembesar-pembesarnya, perwira-perwiranya dan",
      "ref_id": "Markus 6:21",
      "book_code": "mrk",
      "book_en": "Mark",
      "book_id": "Markus",
      "word_count": 20
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "diatessaron_verse": "12",
      "ref": "Mark 6:21",
      "arabic_page": 70,
      "text": "orang-orang terkemuka di Galilea.",
      "ref_id": "Markus 6:21",
      "book_code": "mrk",
      "book_en": "Mark",
      "book_id": "Markus",
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "diatessaron_verse": "12",
      "ref": "Mark 6:22",
      "arabic_page": 70,
      "text": "Pada waktu itu anak perempuan Herodias tampil lalu menari, dan ia menyukakan hati Herodes dan tamu-tamunya. Raja berkata kepada gadis itu:",
